  "title": {
   "en": "Flowers Are Bait"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "꽃은 미끼야"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "At the Spruce Tree Hospital, there’s a rather special patient. He’s been hidden in secret for two years by tree doctor So Iyeon, a man in a vegetative state.\n“Please don’t wake up. Please, just don’t wake up.”\nHer only wish was to live quietly, and every night, she prayed for this.\nThen one day, whether by miracle or misfortune, the man in the coma awakens from his long sleep!\n“Did you come here to suck off this worthless bastard?”\nFaced with a man who has lost both his memory and common sense, she panics in fear of his murderous nature, and tells an irreversible lie.\n“I’m Kwon Chaewoo’s... w-wife.”\nThe same man who, two years ago, buried someone alive in the mountains behind their house and tried to kill her!"
  },
